# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh, savechk_all.py). Hand-made
# from frame dumps of the played build, not from a TAS.
# SAVE-2 (port-savechk2). Copy Data from the slot the source list opens on (the last game saved) to the slot the destination list opens on (the first empty one). In the P5.3b chain, after c1_copy13 (slots 1 and 3 full): slot 1 copied to slot 2 while slot 3 is full (the PC writes the save at frame 2,002). In the options-on chain (slots 1 and 2 full, slot 2 the last saved): slot 2 copied to slot 3. Writes the destination slot only.
# 2600 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu
000*98
080*2      # 1400: Down, Restart Chapter
000*48
080*2      # 1450: Down, Copy Data
000*98
001*2      # 1550: A, Copy Data: the source list
000*148
001*2      # 1700: A, source: the slot the list opens on
000*298
001*2      # 2000: A, destination: the slot the list opens on
000*598
